@startuml component-interaction
title Component interaction in vertical up/down layout

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam ranksep 48
skinparam nodesep 36
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #2F4F7F
  FontColor #111827
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #9A3412
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam folder {
  BorderColor #7C5A2F
  FontColor #111827
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

rectangle "UI Pages\nindex.php, project.php, task.php\nlogin.php, register.php, profile.php" as PAGES #E9F2FF
rectangle "Client Layer\njs/*.js and css/*.css" as ASSETS #E8FAFF
rectangle "API Endpoints\nauth.php, projects.php, tasks.php\nmembers.php, join-requests.php" as API #EAF9EA
rectangle "Core Includes\nincludes/session.php, functions.php\nconfig.php, db-connect.php" as CORE #F6F6F6
database "Persistent Data\nusers, projects\nproject_members\nproject_join_requests\ntasks" as DB #FFE8D9
folder "Schema Scripts\ndatabase/schema.sql\ndatabase/sample-data.sql" as DBSRC #F5F7FA
folder "Attachment Storage\nuploads/attachments" as FILES #FFF5E8

PAGES -[hidden]down- ASSETS
ASSETS -[hidden]down- API
API -[hidden]down- CORE
CORE -[hidden]down- DB
DBSRC -[hidden]right- DB
DB -[hidden]right- FILES

PAGES -down-> ASSETS : (1) UI events
ASSETS -down-> API : (2) AJAX / Fetch
API -down-> CORE : (3) auth + domain checks
CORE -down-> DB : (4) SQL execution

DB -up-> CORE : (5) rows / status
CORE -up-> API : (6) validated payload
API -up-> ASSETS : (7) JSON response
ASSETS -up-> PAGES : (8) DOM refresh

DBSRC ..> DB : (9) migrate / seed
API --> FILES : (10) attachment metadata
FILES --> API : (11) file URL / path

legend bottom
Vertical runtime lane:
UI -> Client -> API -> Includes -> DB
and response lane goes upward back to UI.
end legend

@enduml
